{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":599.72998046875,"text":"And because we are the firm and not just a SaaS company, we've been changing and standardizing how work happens in the firm in the first place and operationalizing that context into our agent state. And because these are our colleagues that use our product, we collect rich reasoning from them that become evals for our system to improve. So I guess there's a question to be asked here. Why do this? What does this unlock? What is the takeaway here? For us, this is our whole thesis, is that we want our platform to be so AI native that agents drive the business. Agents run the business. They are making the decisions that shape our outcomes. And so at ARCA, when people log in, they see a list of tasks that have been prepared for them by agents. They've already read that email. They've looked at the document that came in. They've done 90% of the work. And they're pulling you in just when it's time for you to act. So building this system lets us get to a point where at ARCA, agents prompt people more than people are prompting agents, which lets our agents drive the work that our firm does. And because agents are driving the work the firm does, agents can drive the business. Let me give you an example. Remember that email that Jane sent us? This is a bit of a failure, because we should have just been proactive about this in the first place. So Jane should never have to send this email. So say at our AI native business, we take on this new goal. Our new goal is proactivity. Every January, prepare each client's tax situation and proactively reach out to them before anyone even asks. This is a new business goal for our business to drive. And in an AI native firm, all we have to do is make this goal part of our agent's set of goals. And because they have the primitives to be able to drive work through people for the business, they start driving this goal. And just like that, you have these analyses being done in January and these one-click approval emails with the full plan for every client showing up on our users' plates. And because they're aligned with the goal of proactivity, they can one-click approve and drive the business towards this new outcome. So this is, I think, the key difference between a company that uses AI tools versus a company that is AI native. In an AI native company, you know you've built one when you can steer your business by steering your agents. And that is our ambition at ARCA. And we're hiring. So please check out our website. Please reach out to me if this is something you're interested in working on, these sorts of problems. And thank you for listening. Thank you. Thank you.  Thank you. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.  Thank you. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.  Thank you. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.","segments":[{"id":0,"seek":0,"start":0.800000011920929,"end":4.679999828338623,"text":" And because we are the firm and not just a SaaS company,","tokens":[50404,400,570,321,366,264,6174,293,406,445,257,49733,2237,11,50598],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2792315185070038,"compression_ratio":1.6419752836227417,"no_speech_prob":0.2041933834552765},{"id":1,"seek":0,"start":4.679999828338623,"end":6.420000076293945,"text":" we've been changing and standardizing","tokens":[50598,321,600,668,4473,293,3832,3319,50685],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2792315185070038,"compression_ratio":1.6419752836227417,"no_speech_prob":0.2041933834552765},{"id":2,"seek":0,"start":6.420000076293945,"end":9.359999656677246,"text":" how work happens in the firm in the first place","tokens":[50685,577,589,2314,294,264,12159,76,294,264,700,1081,50832],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2792315185070038,"compression_ratio":1.6419752836227417,"no_speech_prob":0.2041933834552765},{"id":3,"seek":0,"start":9.359999656677246,"end":14.1599998474121